  componentDescription: Each stat pool can be used as a resource to cast spells or
    activate abilities. A character will die if a stat pool like life blood or spirit
    reaches zero. Damage Shield is a special pool that absorbs damage directed at
    a life pool...it will break for a certain amount of time if it reaches zero,
    during that time the shield pool will not regenerate.
